&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;ierturk@DESKTOP-JC8L4M1:~$ cd Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;ierturk@DESKTOP-JC8L4M1:~$ sudo apt-get install git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;ierturk@DESKTOP-JC8L4M1:~$ git clone https://github.com/ierturk/rust-embedded-wsl-probe-rs.git&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open folder &lt;code&gt;rust-embedded-wsl-probe-rs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Now just open debug tab and hit the button&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Place breakpoints where you want&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit the play button&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then it should be displayed following screen
